        "en": "Annual company contribution"
      },
      "basis": "Yearly contribution to the social insurance fund (amount in belgian-rules.json). A starting company is exempt during the first 3 years from the year of incorporation when its directors were self-employed for no more than 12 of the 40 quarters before incorporation (question 2.9): then the line starts after the exemption, or is left out when that is after the plan.",
      "compute": "company_contribution"
